==========================================================
IMPLEMENTATION RULES
==========================================================

Before implementing any backend module:

1. Analyze the existing frontend implementation.
2. Preserve all current UI behavior.
3. Replace only the corresponding mock layer.
4. Do not break existing routes.
5. Keep TypeScript types synchronized.
6. Generate production-quality code only.
7. Follow Clean Architecture and SOLID principles.
8. Use dependency injection throughout.
9. Write reusable, scalable, and well-documented code.
10. After completing each phase, stop and wait for approval before proceeding to the next phase.


